Thank you for introducing me to new writers and topics. There were so many amazing posts this time around!

Here are a few that really stood out to me:

@omarafifi — My Phone Broke and Gemini Fixed It

@sweetpapa — 26 Ways to Use Coding Agents for Non-Coding Tasks

@kenielzep97 — The Art of the Misconception

@tagzauthor — The Third Way Through AI

@tanay_dwivedi9098 — I Developed an App That Can Kill You

@alptekin — Dreams & Cheers 

@sameerqaiser17 — If-Else Statements: When I Finally Got It

Every one of these had something epic to offer! ✨

